S6: sign-in and credential checkpoints

Owner-only staging page. Output below is masked: fixed text, exit codes, paths, modes, sizes, key names, states and timestamps. The terminal is not recorded. Run the steps in order; each waits until it is done.

If a step reports an error: stop there, click Recover, then Stop and wipe.

